### Data Model & Core DAX Measures
### Curated Table Schema (`curated_trade_kpis`)

Field Name	Type	Description
`trade_year`	`INT`	Transaction Year
`trade_month`	`INT`	Transaction Month
`country`	`STRING`	Destination/Origin Country
`usastate`	`STRING`	US State Identifier
`commodity2`	`STRING`	Commodity Category
`trdtype`	`STRING`	Import / Export Classification
`aggregate_trade_value`	`DOUBLE`	Total Financial Trade Value
`aggregate_freight_charges`	`DOUBLE`	Total Freight & Shipping Costs
`aggregate_shipping_weight`	`DOUBLE`	Total Weight (Kilograms/Pounds)
`total_shipments`	`BIGINT`	Total Count of Distinct Shipments



Key DAX Measures (`_Measures` Table)
```dax
-- Total Financial Value
Total Trade Value = 
SUM(curated_trade_kpis[aggregate_trade_value])

-- Total Freight Cost
Total Freight Cost = 
SUM(curated_trade_kpis[aggregate_freight_charges])

-- Total Volume Shipped
Total Shipping Weight = 
SUM(curated_trade_kpis[aggregate_shipping_weight])

-- Total Shipment Count
Total Shipments = 
SUM(curated_trade_kpis[total_shipments])

-- Average Freight Cost Per Shipment
Avg Freight Cost per Shipment = 
DIVIDE([Total Freight Cost], [Total Shipments], 0)
```

